From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.networking.connectivity: ConnectionProfileFilter and FindConnectionProfilesAsync (3669)

windows.networking.connectivity: ConnectionProfileFilter, FindConnectionProfilesAsync

NetworkInformation also exposes INetworkInformationStatics2.
FindConnectionProfilesAsync narrows the connection profiles by the properties
set on a ConnectionProfileFilter (IsConnected, IsWwan/IsWlanConnectionProfile,
NetworkCostType, ServiceProviderGuid). The class and its interfaces are added
to the IDL (IIDs from windows-rs 0.58.0 and checked against the vtable order).
---
